<section class="container page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Reference library</p><h1>Instrument catalogues.</h1><p class="lead">Browse the supplied PDF catalogues, then include product references in your enquiry. Current availability, specifications and document revisions are confirmed individually.</p><a class="button" href="/products">Search online instruments <%- include('partials/icon',{name:'search'}) %></a></section>
<section class="container section-topless"><div class="download-list"><% for(const c of categories.filter(c=>c.pdf)){ %><a href="/documents/<%= c.pdf %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="icon-label"><%- include('partials/icon',{name:c.slug || c.id}) %><%= c.name %></span><span>PDF · <%= c.pages %> pages <span class="sr-only">opens in a new tab</span> <%- include('partials/icon',{name:'download'}) %></span></a><% } %></div><p class="small-note">These are supplied reference catalogues. Their contents do not establish current regulatory approval, certification, stock or manufacturing capacity.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button outline" href="/request-quote?intent=catalogue">Request catalogue assistance by email <%- include('partials/icon',{name:'email'}) %></a><a class="text-link" href="/quality">Discuss applicable documentation ↗</a></div></section>
